WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.208 --> 00:00:03.920
Kaneda collapses,
unable to absorb the attack!

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:06.464
You were amazing.

00:00:07.257 --> 00:00:08.842
Suekichi Kaneda.

00:00:09.676 --> 00:00:12.846
Your courage deserves praise.

00:00:14.764 --> 00:00:16.808
Don't take me lightly, you prick.

00:00:17.267 --> 00:00:18.184
Huh?

00:00:19.102 --> 00:00:21.938
You are the unified champion
in boxing, right?

00:00:22.981 --> 00:00:25.066
And this is your fighting style?

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.194
Why didn't you continue attacking?

00:00:29.070 --> 00:00:33.783
Only one more attack was needed
to make you the winner for sure.

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:36.244
Were you going easy on me?

00:00:36.786 --> 00:00:39.539
Because I'm the weak one?

00:00:41.416 --> 00:00:44.127
I've been a fan of you

00:00:44.669 --> 00:00:47.213
since long before this match.

00:00:47.714 --> 00:00:50.258
I repeatedly watched your matches.

00:00:50.842 --> 00:00:54.387
No gloves, no shoes, and no rules.

00:00:55.221 --> 00:01:00.560
Free from all the limitations, you can do
far more than this if you fight seriously!

00:01:01.519 --> 00:01:03.146
You have a lot of spirit.

00:01:03.897 --> 00:01:06.149
But the result is now absolute.

00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:10.403
I admire you, Suekichi Kaneda.

00:01:11.154 --> 00:01:15.742
I'm happy to unexpectedly see
a true warrior like you.

00:01:16.993 --> 00:01:17.869
But...

00:01:19.162 --> 00:01:22.165
there is a great wall standing between us.

00:01:23.166 --> 00:01:27.170
-I don't want to kill--
-So you're taking me lightly!

00:01:27.587 --> 00:01:30.882
I know well that I have no talent.

00:01:31.299 --> 00:01:32.300
But...

00:01:33.051 --> 00:01:35.428
it's the only thing I can do!

00:01:35.845 --> 00:01:37.138
This man...

00:01:37.597 --> 00:01:41.559
No one should judge me.

00:01:42.477 --> 00:01:46.606
What's wrong with the weak
aiming to be the strong?!

00:01:47.565 --> 00:01:48.483
Kaneda...

00:01:49.317 --> 00:01:50.860
OHMA TOKITA
YAMASHITA CORPORATION

00:01:51.486 --> 00:01:53.613
You finally showed your true colors.

00:01:54.572 --> 00:01:55.782
It took too long.

00:01:58.284 --> 00:01:59.661
I see now.

00:02:01.037 --> 00:02:04.040
Among the fighters in this tournament,
he's the only one

00:02:04.499 --> 00:02:07.293
who took over this tournament
as the weak one.

00:02:08.628 --> 00:02:11.339
He fights to break away
from being weak.

